      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Offline voice clone — M2 Max\n\n**Default engine:** Qwen3-TTS 12Hz 1.7B **Base** (zero-shot clone).\n**Device:** engine dropdown is `auto`/`cuda`/`cpu`. On Apple Silicon, TTS Audio Suite resolves `auto` → **MPS**.\n**Precision:** `float32`. Base clone on MPS NaNs in fp16/bf16.\n**Attention:** `sdpa`. Do not use flash-attn or CUDA graphs.\n**torch.compile:** off.\n**Runtime:** Shared Runtime (Qwen3 is fragile on Transformers 5 in the main env).\n\n## Reference\n1. `./extract_reference.sh clip.mp4` → 6–15s mono 22050 Hz WAV\n2. Copy to Comfy input as `voice_clone/reference.wav`\n3. Paste the **exact transcript** into Character Voices\n4. Queue **only the Qwen group** first. Unmute F5 for A/B.\n\nUnload large FLUX/LTX graphs before running TTS if VRAM/unified memory is contended.\nNo cloud APIs. First run may download; after cache, offline."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
