      "widgets_values": [
        "# F5-TTS v1 A/B (muted by default)\n\nSame reference + transcript as Qwen3.\nThis group is **never** (`mode 4`) so a default queue does not load F5.\n\nTo A/B: select the F5 TTS Text node → bypass off, then queue.\nF5 **requires** matching reference text. Device dropdown here includes `mps` — leave it on `mps`.\nF5-TTS v1 Base auto-downloads to `models/TTS/F5-TTS/F5TTS_v1_Base/` on first unmuted run."
      ],
